\par\par \b \uc2 News Highlights: Top Economic Stories of the Day\b0\par\par\uc2 696 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Oktober 2012\par 08:52\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par OECD Says Japan Debt In 'Uncharted Territory' \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Japan's huge public debt load puts the world's third-largest economy in "unchartered territory," the head of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Organization for Economic Cooperation and Development\f28 \uc2 \f2  says.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 IMF\f28 \uc2 \f2  Says Africa Growth at Risk \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Sub-Saharan Africa looks set to record strong growth through next year--a bright spot in a mostly lackluster global economy--but the world's poorest region remains vulnerable to events far beyond its borders, the \f28 \uc2 \f2 IMF\f28 \uc2 \f2  says.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Germany Says Slashing Debt a Must \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Germany's finance minister says there is "no alternative" to cutting debt in European countries, a day after the \f28 \uc2 \f2 IMF\f28 \uc2 \f2  calls for Greece to be given more time to trim its budget.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par China Guides Yuan Up in Possible Political Gesture \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Beijing guides the yuan sharply higher against the U.S. dollar, in what may be a conciliatory gesture to exchange-rate hawks in Washington just weeks ahead of the U.S. presidential election.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 IMF\f28 \uc2 \f2  Lowers Growth Outlook for Asia \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 International Monetary Fund\f28 \uc2 \f2  cuts its expectations for growth in Asia, said the region will continue to power the world economy and added that China is likely to avoid a hard landing.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Japan Cuts Economic Assessment Again \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Japanese government cut its assessment of the economy for the third straight month in October, as a slowdown in the global economy weighed on exports and production.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Bankers to Meet on Preventing Greece Contagion \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 International lenders will discuss an emergency lifeboat worth up to \u8364\'20\'AC15 billion aimed at preventing the Greek crisis from pushing vulnerable European countries into deeper recession, The Times in the U.K. reports.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -- Greece, Troika Talks Progress\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Spain Sets Capital-Ratio Requirement of 9% \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Spain's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sets a new core capital-ratio target for Spanish banks of 9% as of Jan. 1, unifying itself with the \f28 \uc2 \f2 European Banking Authority\f28 \uc2 \f2 , Cinco Dias reports.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Fortescue Expects to Raise $5B From Credit Facility \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Fortescue Metals\f28 \uc2 \f2 , the world's fourth-largest iron ore producer, expects to raise as much as $5 billion from its new credit facility, due to strong demand.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Monti: ESM Should 'Rapidly' Recapitalize Banks \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The euro-zone bailout fund should be able to directly recapitalize weak banks "rapidly" after a single bank supervisor is set up in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  bloc, Italian prime minister Mario Monti says, according to text of a speech distributed before delivery.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Fed's Balance Sheet Expands in Latest Week \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Federal Reserve\f28 \uc2 \f2 's balance sheet expands over the past week, climbing to $2.813 trillion from $2.810 trillion a week earlier, as the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  continues its latest round of buying mortgage-backed securities.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par ANALYSIS & COMMENTARY \par  \par ELECTION 2012 \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Biden, Ryan Square Off on Iran, Economy: \f28 \uc2 \f2 Joe Biden\f28 \uc2 \f2  and Paul Ryan square off over foreign policy and the U.S. economy in their vice-presidential debate, with both candidates unleashing sharp one-liners aimed at turning the tide in a close presidential election.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -- Sharp Jabs Dominate VP Debate\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -- Streaming Coverage of Election 2012\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par THE WALL STREET JOURNAL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Younger Chinese Get Feel For Debt: Long a nation that preferred cash to credit cards, China is taking on an increasing amount of debt and opening its market to more lenders, as younger people are willing to take on loans, writes Laurie Burkitt.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par THE WALL STREET JOURNAL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 South Africa Falters as Unrest Spreads: Black households in South Africa today earn less compared with their white neighbors than they did when apartheid ended in 1994 and the disenchantment with government is fanning protests across the country, Patrick McGroarty and Devon Maylie report.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par INTERVIEW \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  May \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  In \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Market Without U.S.: Japanese Economy Minister Seiji Maehara says Tokyo may \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market on its own to rein in the yen's strength, even without the consent of the United States.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par THE WALL STREET JOURNAL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Economists See Slowing Decline in Unemployment: The jobless rate fell by 0.5 percentage-point over the past two months, but economists in the a Wall Street Journal forecasting survey don't expect that pace of decline to continue, citing expectations for lackluster economic growth into 2013. [ 12-10-12 0652GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1030 1804 4180   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020121012e8ac000db\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
