\par\par \b \uc2 DJ  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  WEEK AHEAD: Investors Focus On Bank of Japan After Fed Decision\b0\par\par\uc2 By Ira Iosebashvili   \par \uc2 479 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 2012\par 12:16\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2012, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 With the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 's third wave of quantitative easing now in the history books, markets are now turning their attention east, as the Bank of Japan mulls weakening the yen in response.\par \par \uc2 Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to keep a watchful eye on the yen right up until its two-day policy meeting on Tuesday. The yen hit a seven-month high of 77.13 to the dollar on Thursday after the Fed announced a third wave of bond buying.\par \par \uc2 The strengthening \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  prompted Japanese Finance Minister Jun Azumi to say he would take "decisive steps" to stem the yen's rise, while traders reported that the Bank of Japan was inquiring with market participants about activity in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a move that often serves as a final warning before \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The yen traded at 78.39 to the dollar Friday afternoon in New York, safely above the "red line" analysts believe would draw \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in October.\par \par \uc2 "The Y76 level is where the Bank of Japan starts looking to take action," said Jens Nordvig, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy at Nomura in New York. "If they \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the yen above those levels, it would certainly be a surprise."\par \par \uc2 Another option for the Bank of Japan would be an expansion of its 70 trillion-yen asset purchasing program, a variant seen by analysts as more likely than outright \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's economic picture has sharply deteriorated in recent months, as slowing global growth has hurt exports. A strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  makes Japanese goods less competitive overseas. The nation's growth rate dropped to an annualized 0.7% in the second quarter from the previous quarter's 5.3%. Some economists now foresee contractions in the next two quarters.\par \par \uc2 If the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  did \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the results would likely be dramatic, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moving anywhere from 2% to 4% shortly after the announcement, Mr. Nordvig said.\par \par \uc2 "They are more than willing to do very big size. Each and every \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has had a huge impact," he said.\par \par \uc2 With the Fed's decision out of the way, markets will also turn their attention to flash Purchasing Manager Index Readings from China and Europe, due Wednesday and Thursday, respectively. China's will be watched with particular interest after the country's last PMI reading came in at nine-month low. Another soft reading would confirm further weakness in the country's manufacturing sector and weigh on the Australian dollar, \uc2 Barclays\uc2  said in a note to investors.\par \par \uc2 In Europe, investors will watch bond auctions in Spain, the first since the \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  pledged to expand its bond-buying program earlier this month.\par \par \uc2 Write to ira.iosebashvili@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 -0-\par \par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2012 \uc2 Dow Jones & Company, Inc\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020120916e89f002bd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
