\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: ICAP's EBS Posts 49% Decline in Average Spot  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Volume\b0\par\par\uc2 578 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 September 2012\par 21:26\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global FX & Fixed Income News\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --EBS's volume hit by slow \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pairs, increased competition\par \par \uc2 --EBS making moves to appease core clients, such as banks\par \par \uc2 (Adds new information beginning in the third paragraph and analyst comments beginning in the fourth paragraph.)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Ira Iosebashvili and Stephen L. Bernard \par  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  volume on electronic trading platform EBS was cut nearly in half last month from a year ago as deadlocked \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  pairs and increased competition hit the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  trading giant.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For August, the average daily volume of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  spot trades settled by \f28 \uc2 \f2 ICAP PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2 's (IAP.LN) EBS unit fell to $95.5 billion, 49% lower than a year ago, data from the company showed Thursday. Last month also recorded the lowest volume since at least January 2006, which is as far back as the company's records go.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 EBS wasn't the only electronic broker to see trading volumes fall, with the industry's other giant trading platform, Thomson Reuters, on Wednesday disclosing its average volume was down 30% on a yearly basis for last month. Hitting trading volume has been a bevy of new smaller players, as well as a series of unsettling economic developments that have pushed investors in many markets to the sidelines, say analysts.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "There are major issues such as global deleveraging, fear of further economic instability and pervasive \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  that are scaring everybody," said Paul Rowady, a senior analyst at market research firm \f28 \uc2 \f2 TABB Group\f28 \uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Average daily volume for August on the New York Stock Exchange was three billion shares traded, the lowest since May 2007. Investors have shown little appetite for commodities as well--trading volumes in oil futures are down 32% on the Nymex from last August, while gold futures volume fell 56% and corn futures fell 12%.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 With volumes dwindling, especially in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , some trading platforms have moved to appease core clients, often large financial institutions. On Tuesday, EBS announced new rules that will simplify trading for banks, while hitting high-speed traders.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The decision was a stark reversal from just a few years ago, when the firm put in place some mechanisms geared specifically for these algorithm-driven traders. But, a saturation of these traders in the aftermath of the changes has hurt the profitability of their trading models lately, with some recently launched platforms increasingly drawing in that business, say analysts.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A representative for EBS wasn't immediately available to comment.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 EBS has also experienced problems more specific to its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  business.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The trading system was especially hard hit by declining volume in the Swiss franc, yen and euro in recent months, analysts said. Those three \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  are among the biggest for EBS, but have seen their volumes fall after the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Swiss National Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2  instituted a floor for the euro against its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . In addition, the threat of Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan currency intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has limited yen movement.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The dollar-yen exchange rate, for example, moved only 0.3% between Aug. 1 and Aug. 31. The euro-yen exchange rate moved less than 0.1% last month.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "There's been a lack of clarity out of the [\f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ]," said \f28 \uc2 \f2 Javier Paz\f28 \uc2 \f2 , a senior analyst at Boston-based consulting firm Aite Group. "The Swiss [franc] is very controlled. It's basically a peg."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Ira Iosebashvili at ira.iosebashvili@dowjones.com and Stephen L. Bernard at stephen.bernard@dowjones.com [ 09-06-12 1526ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020120906e8960004r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
