\par\par \b \uc2 MARKET TALK: Asian Summary; Stocks Mixed, HSBC China PMI Supports\b0\par\par\uc2 331 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juli 2012\par 07:58\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 0558 GMT [Dow Jones] ASIAN SUMMARY: Regional markets are mixed amid ongoing euro zone debt worries, but a report showing improvement in China's manufacturing sector offers some support. The Nikkei is down 0.1%, the S&P/ASX is up 0.2%, the HSI adds 0.3%, the Kospi is up 0.3%, the Taiex slips 0.3%, the Sensex gains 0.3%, the Shanghai Composite rises 0.5%, the STI gains 0.7% and the KLCI falls 0.3%. In \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, the USD and EUR remained relatively stable against the JPY, as concerns over a potential \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the JPY's strength keeps yen-crosses from sliding lower. The EUR/JPY is at 94.94 from 94.98 late Monday in New York, while the USD/JPY is at 78.32 from 78.40 and the EUR/USD is at 1.2122 from 1.2117.\par \par \uc2  The preliminary HSBC China Manufacturing Purchasing Managers Index rises to a five-month high at 49.5 in July compared with a final reading of 48.2 in June, helping ease market concerns over a sharp slowdown in the world's second-largest economy. RBA Governor Glenn Stevens says monetary policy settings are "about right". "Our recent communication is that we think the setting is about right for the circumstances that we face," Stevens tells attendees at a charity lunch in Sydney. Taiwan's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  leaves its overnight interest rate unchanged at 0.388% Tuesday, after cutting rates in the previous seven trading days, suggesting its latest easing cycle might have ended. Spot gold is at $1577.50/oz, up 80 cents from the NY close. September Nymex crude oil futures are up 73 cents at $88.87/bbl. (philip.vahn@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in Singapore. 65 64154 140; MarketTalk@dowjones.com \par  \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 24-07-12 0558GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1012 1085 1106 75112 75117   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120724e87o000aj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
