\par\par \b \uc2 News Highlights: Top Economic Stories of the Day\b0\par\par\uc2 442 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Juli 2012\par 11:10\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par SWISS \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCY\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  RESERVES SURGE IN JUNE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Value of the SNB's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves climb to a record CHF364.9 billion in June, confirming the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the markets to keep the franc just below the CHF1.20-per-euro level.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par GERMAN TWO-YEAR YIELDS TURN NEGATIVE AFTER ECB RATE CUT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The effects of the ECB's unprecedented move to slash deposit rates to zero reverberate around government bond markets as yields on some types of German bonds sink back into negative territory.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par ECB CHIEF AIRS CAUTION ABOUT REGULATORY ROLE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mario Draghi warns that expanding the institution's powers into banking regulation could put its credibility at risk unless strong protections are put in place.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par JAPAN WARNS OF CASH CRUNCH WITHOUT BOND BILL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Japan's finance minister calls on opposition lawmakers to quickly pass a debt-issuance bill, saying the government will otherwise have to sharply curb spending.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par LAGARD SAYS CO-ORDINATED YEN \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 INTERVENTION\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  JUSTIFIABLE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Head of the IMF says \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would be justified in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets as long as it's done in tandem with other nations.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par ITALY APPROVES EUR4.5B IN 2012 SPENDING CUTS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Italy's government approves EUR4.5 billion in spending cuts for 2012 aimed at slashing the size of Italy's bloated public sector and delaying a new tax increase until after the first half of 2013.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par JAPAN'S PM CONVEYS YEN CONCERNS TO IMF \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Japan's prime minister tells the visiting head of the IMF that the yen's strength is causing the nation's economy serious damage.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par MOODY'S SAYS EU PACT COULD UNDERMINE STRONG COUNTRIES \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Moody's\f28 \uc2 \f2  warns an EU agreement to allow greater access to bailout funds will provide support to weak European economies, but comes at a high cost of diluting the creditworthiness of the strong ones.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par PORTUGAL COURT RULES WAGE CUTS CAN'T BE FOR PUBLIC SECTOR ONLY \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Portugal's government suffers a major setback after a court ruled it can't apply wage cuts in 2013 and 2014 only to public workers as it wanted under a plan to meet budget deficit targets.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par BUNDESBANK'S WEIDMANN CRITICIZES EU SUMMIT CONCLUSIONS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bundesbank President Jens Weidmann criticizes the results of last week's landmark euro-zone summit, warning that leaders failed to clarify whether they are moving toward greater fiscal union.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 STRIDES ARCOLAB\f28 \uc2 \f2 : LOOKING AT SWAPPING RUPEE LOANS WITH OVERSEAS DEBT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Strides Arcolab Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . is exploring an option of replacing 3 billion rupees ($54 million) of costly local loans with cheaper overseas borrowings, the generic drug maker's chief financial officer said. [ 06-07-12 0910GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 1030 1804 4180   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120706e876000jt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
