\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  FOCUS: The Greek Influence on Japanese  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 623 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juni 2012\par 11:49\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --Left-wing victory in Greece will lift safe haven flows\par \par \uc2 --Impact of BOJ monetary easing may be diminishing\par \par \uc2 --\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be more keen to curb JPY rise with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 By Nicholas Hastings\par \par \uc2 The risk of yen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is on the rise.\par \par \uc2 With the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  showing little sign of a serious bounce for most of this year and with Greek election results likely to intensify safe haven flows even further, chances are that the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  will have to wade into the market to sell the yen.\par \par \uc2 Even the International Monetary Fund has acknowledged as much, stating in its annual review of the Japanese economy that safe haven flows have made the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  overvalued and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be used to avoid disorderly markets.\par \par \uc2 The IMF also recognized the need for further monetary easing if the government is going to achieve its goal of a 1% inflation rate by the end of 2014.\par \par \uc2 All of this must have come as music to the government's ears as it continues to press the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  to expand its asset purchases program further and help to offset the tightening impact of a strong yen.\par \par \uc2 To help ensure a favorable mix on the board of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the government has nominated two well known doves--Nomura chief economist Takahide Kiuchi and Morgan Stanley chief economist Takehiro Sato--to replace two of the members that have retired on the nine-member board. The government had previously rejected the nomination of a hawk.\par \par \uc2 With the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  holding its next policy meeting as early as this Thursday, some analysts are suggesting that the bank will make a pre-emptive move on policy given that underlying price pressure remains very weak. Although Japan may yet attain 2% growth this year, it will probably fall back to 1.75% next year.\par \par \uc2 However, more asset purchases by the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  may not be the answer.\par \par \uc2 Like other major central banks that have pursued this route of monetary easing to help their recoveries, the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  has found that the economic impact of asset purchases has diminished in recent months.\par \par \uc2 If true, this means that the yen itself will become even more important as a policy tool for the Japanese authorities and their tolerance of its recent strength is only likely to diminish.\par \par \uc2 The value of the yen against the dollar rose by one-third between the middle of 2007 and late 2010. Since then, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has continued to bounce around either just above or just below the Y80 level, providing little respite for Japanese exporters.\par \par \uc2 If, as many fear, the Greeks elect a left-wing government on Sunday that rejects the terms of the multi-billion-euro bail out program and makes the country's exit from the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  even more likely, then the safe haven flows into the yen will only intensify and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could embark on a fresh rally.\par \par \uc2 If the government is worried that even \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  easing won't be able to help the economy much at this stage, it will be even more anxious to curb the yen's rally and will probably instruct the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  to stop it.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg TNI FRX POV\par \par \uc2 Reuters USD/DJ\par \par \uc2 Thomson P/1066 or P/1074\par \par \uc2 (Nicholas Hastings is a Senior Correspondent in London for Dow Jones Newswires who has written about \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  for more than 20 years. He previously covered a variety of markets, including equities, fixed income, commodities and energy. He can be contacted on +44-20-7842-9493 or by email: nick.hastings@dowjones.com or on twitter @NickHastingsDJ) [ 12-06-12 0949GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1066   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120612e86c000l5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
